TASK-132.16 runtime harness: installs the API Explorer into an isolated profile over a local site (scratchpad: alpha/bravo/charlie.html with early console lines, an image and an unreachable image; python3 -m http.server 8767); attaches a parked tab (page) and the selected tab (worker); reloads while attached and checks Runtime.enable replays the early messages; console, exception, fetch/XHR (200, 501 for POST on python's server, failure), the document under its loader id and both images; the worker receives the selected tab's events; an unattached tab is not wrapped; detach restores console/fetch and leaves no scripts. Temporary, never committed to Detour/.

    git apply docs/harness/task132.16-harness.patch && xcodegen generate && build

    DETOUR_DATA_DIR=DetourVerify13216-<n> DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR=$OUT DETOUR_API_EXPLORER=$PWD/TestExtensions/api-explorer DETOUR_VERIFY_SITE=http://127.0.0.1:8767 .derived/.../Detour

    # results in $OUT/verify.log; ends with "done".
    # "SHOOT <name> <windowNumber>" lines cue `screencapture -x -o -l <windowNumber>` (Screen Recording granted to the
    # shell host, sandbox off). The timestamp is space-padded ("[  16.129] SHOOT …"), so take the LAST two fields
    # (awk '{print $(NF-1), $NF}'): `read -r _ _ name win` puts the name into `win` and screencapture then fails with
    # "could not create image from window".

